# Kind27Waiter (83:9F2F) at its own entry. Kind27Start reaches it by a
# branch (83:9F1B), where the per-call check opens no call, so A5 had none
# to judge. The kind $27 beside Aladdin at record $0CEB, played to as
# cov_kind27_parts.box (running at 83:9F2B with $07 = $10): its $07 set to
# 0 (the variant that waits) and its resume address to 83:9F2F (the
# record's P, PC and bank at +2), as the actor loop resumes it; $036C set
# 10 frames on: it rises, circles and flies its three rounds.
load build/aladdin/states/pw1.state
hold DOWN 75
hold DOWN 61
hold Y+LEFT 28
hold DOWN+A 64
hold B+RIGHT 16
hold B 15
hold L 9
hold R 61
hold X 87
hold RIGHT 71
hold RIGHT 28
hold X 7
hold Y+RIGHT 60
hold B+RIGHT 70
hold A+RIGHT 67
press START
wait 60
press START
hold RIGHT 30
poke 000CF2 00
poke 000CED 30,2F,9F,83
wait 10
poke 00036C 01
wait 900
